  "notes": "One consolidated QGIP expenditure CSV per fiscal year (2020-21 uses the corrected \"updated DTMR data\" file only). Existing 2024-25 rows are preserved untouched. Only Grant (grant_award) and Frontline service procurement (contract) are ingested; Concession, Loan and Direct government investment are rejected, as are zero-dollar rows. Grants and contracts are never summed, and years are never merged. 2019-20 is partial because the publisher left Financial year expenditure blank on 22,530/27,308 rows; the cumulative total-to-date is never added to or substituted for an annual payment. No COFOG function; provisional and unverified. Bytes are archived outside the repo."
